{
  "_comment": "Shared validation cases for NewMeeting: run by server/src/meeting_validation.rs (prepare_meeting_batch: content rules, then the place or online details, with \"p1\" as the only stored place) and web/src/bulkImport.test.ts (validateFields; the web test resolves place_id against its own place list and uses an unknown place_id as the JSON place name). Each case applies an RFC 7396 merge patch to base, then optionally sets the string at fill.path to fill.text repeated fill.count times. error is the server's message of the first violated rule, null means valid; client_error, if present, is the bulk import's own wording for the same rule (it talks about the JSON fields). Invisible characters are written as \\u escapes.",
